From abb8ae7c36875d6a946304dece2a096cb5455786 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 00:14:56 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Energy in items any mod moves (round 4 item 5, API 51)

An item declares "energy": {capacity, max_insert, max_extract} in content
(NeoForge's item IEnergyStorage, FE); what it holds is its horizon:energy
component. recipe-types.item-energy reads it, item-energy-insert and
item-energy-extract charge and drain a stack (with simulate) and give it
back. Example energy-items-demo.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
